    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nInterested in this property? Sign up for mySherryFitz to arrange your viewing, see current offers or make your own offer. Register now at SherryFitz.ie\n\nSherry FitzGerald Conor McManus are pleased to present to the market No. 4 Drumbear, Monaghan.\n\nAn immaculate detached bungalow enjoying a highly convenient location along the Cootehill Road in Monaghan town centre and its wide range of everyday amenities.\n\nExternally, the home is complemented by a mature front garden with established hedging, off-street parking and a particularly useful detached outbuilding/workshop to the rear.\n\nThe accommodation comprises an entrance hall, sitting room, kitchen/dining room, four bedrooms, bathroom, together with an additional bedroom/home office and WC, offering excellent flexibility for those requiring a fifth bedroom, guest accommodation or dedicated workspace.\n\nThe opportunity to acquire a one-off dwelling in this location is seldom and viewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall: - \nBright and welcoming entrance hall with tiled flooring, glazed surrounds providing excellent natural light and useful built-in storage.\n\nLiving Room: - \nBright living room with dual-aspect windows, wood-effect flooring and a feature solid-fuel stove with tiled hearth.\n\nKitchen Dining Room: - \nSpacious kitchen and dining area fitted with a range of wall and floor units, ample worktop space and tiled flooring. Dual-aspect windows provide good natural light, with generous space for a dining table and chairs.\n\nBedroom 1: - \nBright and well-proportioned double bedroom with built-in wardrobes, wood-effect flooring and a window providing natural light.\n\nBedroom 2: - \nGenerously proportioned double bedroom with wood-effect flooring, ample space for bedroom furniture and a large window providing plenty of natural light\n\nBedroom 3: - \nComfortable double bedroom with wood-effect flooring, neutral décor and a window providing natural light.\n\nBedroom 4: - \nBright double bedroom with built-in wardrobe, wood-effect flooring and a large window overlooking the rear garden.\n\nBathroom: - \nShower room comprising a corner shower enclosure, WC and pedestal wash hand basin. Dual frosted windows provide natural light and privacy\n\nOffice: - \nBright and versatile room with wood-effect flooring. Currently used as an office/utility space but suitable for use as an additional bedroom\n\nWC: - \nFitted with WC and wash hand basin, tiled walls and built-in storage.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Total floor area: 111 sq m (1195 sq ft) approximately</li><li>Flexible layout suitable for a variety of family needs</li><li>Single storey living with easy access to town centre</li><li>Generous kitchen/dining room</li><li>Separate sitting room</li><li>Additional bedroom/home office offering excellent versatility</li><li>WC/shower room plus additional WC</li><li>Detached outbuilding/workshop to the rear</li><li>Mature front garden with established hedging</li><li>Off-street parking</li><li>Convenient location on the Cootehill Road</li><li>Within easy reach of Monaghan town centre</li><li>Close to a wide range of shops, schools and everyday amenities</li><li>Upvc double glazing</li><li>Gas central heating</li><li>Broadband available</ul>"
      },
      {
